{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SQR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">YOU ARE SQR. PART OF YOU IS MISSING.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433200/extras/DescriptionGif1.gif?t=1741115202\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">SQR is a challenging, fast thinking puzzle game, wearing a deceptively simple coat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In SQR you must use a unique colour swapping mechanic to navigate and complete over 90 levels, and overcome an increasingly complex array of colour themed obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">FIND WHAT IS MISSING.<br>BLEND IN.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Accessibility</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">SQR Features\u00a0Red-Green Color Blind support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"WARPZONE 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3433200/eb8325d9e6de2308321dfda7fb440767c2103a69.jpg"},{"name":"WARPZONE 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3433200/dad74728acae3357fb065a0e977fabf11dddb051.jpg"},{"name":"WARPZONE 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3433200/28693375ad6d2b5890321d1c9f7258267537717a.jpg"},{"name":"WARPZONE 4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3433200/f6a50e0cb8522a2f2411b84d19021b2f8a6a92b4.jpg"},{"name":"WARPZONE 5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3433200/f6513429b4db32a4a572b718103427a2b845bca7.jpg"},{"name":"WARPZONE 6","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3433200/b205d118641e65deff6ed1d512c3397c8875a3e0.jpg"},{"name":"EMBRACED","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3433200/8e3a97fcebed797a76ef2de3e73f3f3c502631d5.jpg"}],"total":7},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.